# Images are built from the repository root; keep the context small and
# free of secrets and local data.
.git
.github
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/bin
**/dist
**/node_modules
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
**/broker-data
**/proxy-token
**/review-data
**/checkout-data
**/workspace-data

# Explorer importer staging and browser reports are not production assets.
**/nudaui/.staging
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
